SECTION F: UNSEEN-GAME / UNKNOWN-SLOT BEHAVIOUR
============================================================
TD-MPC2 conditions every component on a learnable task embedding but states
it 'requires training on all target tasks simultaneously rather than enabling
zero-shot generalization to completely unseen tasks'. The UNKNOWN slot is the
mechanism meant to close that gap; this section is the test of whether it did.

